@mikhajlov_pavel_kt_31_23_HostAddress = http://localhost:5033

### Students - Get All / Filtered via GET
GET {{mikhajlov_pavel_kt_31_23_HostAddress}}/students
Accept: application/json

###

### Students - Get Disciplines with Grades by FirstName
GET {{mikhajlov_pavel_kt_31_23_HostAddress}}/students/disciplines?firstName=Павел
Accept: application/json

###

### Students - Filter by Group and Name
GET {{mikhajlov_pavel_kt_31_23_HostAddress}}/students?groupId=1&firstName=Иван&isDeleted=false
Accept: application/json

###

### Students - Add Student (POST)
POST {{mikhajlov_pavel_kt_31_23_HostAddress}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Иванов",
  "groupId": 1
}

###

